<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>NEON CITY 2077</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@300;400;700&display=swap');

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #0a0a0f;
      font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 98%, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.03) 98%),
        linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 98%, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.03) 98%);
      background-size: 50px 50px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .glitch-bg {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,
        #0a0a0f 0%,
        #1a0a2e 30%,
        #0f1a2e 60%,
        #0a0a0f 100%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .scanlines {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        transparent,
        transparent 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
      opacity: 0.1;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      position: relative;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 10px;
      position: relative;
      animation: glitch 2s infinite;
    }

    h1::before,
    h1::after {
      content: 'NEON CITY';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    h1::before {
      color: #ff00ff;
      animation: glitch-1 0.3s infinite;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 35%, 0 35%);
      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    }

    h1::after {
      color: #00ffff;
      animation: glitch-2 0.3s infinite;
      clip-path: polygon(0 65%, 100% 65%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
      transform: translate(2px, 2px);
    }

    @keyframes glitch-1 {
      0%, 100% { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); }
      25% { transform: translate(2px, 0px); }
      50% { transform: translate(-1px, 2px); }
      75% { transform: translate(1px, -1px); }
    }

    @keyframes glitch-2 {
      0%, 100% { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }
      25% { transform: translate(-2px, 1px); }
      50% { transform: translate(1px, -2px); }
      75% { transform: translate(-1px, 1px); }
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #00ffff;
      letter-spacing: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ffff, 0 0 20px #00ffff, 0 0 40px #00ffff;
    }

    .neon-line {
      width: 80%;
      height: 2px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent,
        #ff00ff,
        #00ffff,
        #ff00ff,
        transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff, 0 0 20px #00ffff;
    }

    .content-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .cyber-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,
        rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1) 0%,
        rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);
      padding: 30px;
      position: relative;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 20px) 0, 100% 20px, 100% 100%, 20px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 20px));
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cyber-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg,
        transparent 40%,
        rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1) 50%,
        transparent 60%);
      animation: shine 3s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes shine {
      0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
      100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
    }

    .cyber-card:hover {
      border-color: #ff00ff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3),
                  inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .cyber-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
      color: #ff00ff;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff;
    }

    .cyber-card p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .cyber-card .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 15px;
      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid #00ffff;
      color: #00ffff;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .stats-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      margin: 60px 0;
      padding: 30px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border-left: 3px solid #ff00ff;
      border-right: 3px solid #00ffff;
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #00ffff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px #00ffff;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.7; }
    }

    .stat-label {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 2px solid #ff00ff;
      color: #ff00ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .back-link::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.4), transparent);
      transition: left 0.5s ease;
    }

    .back-link:hover::before {
      left: 100%;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.5);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 80px;
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    footer p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="glitch-bg"></div>
  <div class="scanlines"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>NEON CITY</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">2 0 7 7</p>
      <div class="neon-line"></div>
    </header>

    <div class="stats-bar">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-number">2.4M</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Citizens</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-number">847</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Megacorps</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-number">99.7%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Connected</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="cyber-card">
        <h3>// NEURAL INTERFACE</h3>
        <p>Direct brain-computer connectivity. Upload your consciousness to the net. Experience reality beyond the physical realm.</p>
        <span class="tag">BIOTECH</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cyber-card">
        <h3>// CHROME UPGRADES</h3>
        <p>Military-grade cybernetic enhancements. Stronger. Faster. Better. Become more than human in the neon-lit streets.</p>
        <span class="tag">CYBERWARE</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cyber-card">
        <h3>// DATA HEIST</h3>
        <p>Corporate secrets waiting to be extracted. High risk, higher reward. Jack in and take what's yours.</p>
        <span class="tag">NETRUNNING</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cyber-card">
        <h3>// NIGHT MARKETS</h3>
        <p>Underground bazaars pulse with illegal mods and black-market tech. Everything has a price in the shadow economy.</p>
        <span class="tag">COMMERCE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">[ Return to Hub ]</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>NEON CITY SYSTEMS // ALL RIGHTS RESERVED // 2077</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
